cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this protocol, screening database, extraction database, or evidence map, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "The Legal Last Mile: A Systematic Review of Legal and Administrative Barriers to Water and Sanitation Access — Protocol, Screening Database, and Evidence Base (Interim)"
abstract: >
  Companion systematic review to the doctoral dissertation "The Legal Last
  Mile: Administrative Law as a Mechanism of Connectivity and Exclusion in
  Sanitation Governance." Pre-specified protocol, inclusion/exclusion
  criteria, and extraction codebook (fixed 2026-08-22, before any database
  was searched), plus the review's title/abstract screening database
  (27,481 deduplicated candidate records from Scopus, Web of Science,
  HeinOnline, ProQuest, ProQuest/Sociological Abstracts, and JSTOR),
  full-text screening database, extraction database, and evidence
  classification map. This is an INTERIM, in-progress deposit: full-text
  screening and extraction are live and ongoing, and risk-of-bias
  appraisal and quantitative-feasibility assessment have not yet started
  -- see PRISMA_WORKFLOW.md and 06_outputs/supplementary/preliminary_results.md
  in this deposit for the current, disclosed status of every phase. Never
  treat any count or figure here as final; re-check the source CSVs and
  changelog for the version actually cited.
authors:
